title: Layers & LUTs
description: Every Pixelmator template as a stack of PNG layers — page colour, backdrop, photo, tint, graphics, subject — with no words and no grid lines baked in, so the same design can be built in any phone app and typed in Geist. Plus the nine LUTs.
eyebrow: Concept · Make
